 this element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"volume","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The volume element value is a percentage of the maximum ranging from 0 to 100, with decimal values allowed. This corresponds to a scaling value for the MIDI 1.0 channel volume controller."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"pan","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The pan and elevation elements allow placing of sound in a 3-D space relative to the listener. Both are expressed in degrees ranging from -180 to 180. For pan, 0 is straight ahead, -90 is hard left, 90 is hard right, and -180 and 180 are directly behind the listener."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"elevation","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The elevation and pan elements allow placing of sound in a 3-D space relative to the listener. Both are expressed in degrees ranging from -180 to 180. For elevation, 0 is level with the listener, 90 is directly above, and -90 is directly below."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlmidiinstrument\/init(id:midichannel:midiname:midibank:midiprogram:midiunpitched:volume:pan:elevation:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMidiInstrument\/init(id:midiChannel:midiName:midiBank:midiProgram:midiUnpitched:volume:pan:elevation:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(id:midiChannel:midiName:midiBank:midiProgram:midiUnpitched:volume:pan:elevation:)","symbolKind":"init","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLMidiInstrumentV2id11midiChannel0F4Name0F4Bank0F7Program0F9Unpitched6volume3pan9elevationACSS_AA9MXLMidi16VSgSSSgAA12MXLMidi16384VSgAA10MXLMidi128VSgAVSdSgA2Wtcfc","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:S